# Build context exclusions.
#
# The Dockerfile copies an explicit allowlist, so this file is defence in depth:
# it guarantees that `.git` history, local secrets, dependency trees and build
# artefacts can never reach the build context, and therefore can never be baked
# into an image even if the Dockerfile is later simplified.

# VCS history contains the full commit log and any credential ever committed.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# Local configuration and secrets. Only .env.example is ever committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dependencies and coverage output.
node_modules
coverage
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Infrastructure and editor state.
.terraform
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
